			"notes": "## 🆕 Orbital Wolf Cannon v1.0.0\n\n### ✨ Features\n- Added **Orbital Wolf Rod**\n- Summons **48 wolves** in a perfect circular formation around the player\n- Wolves are:\n  - 🐺 Tamed to the player\n  - 🛡️ Equipped with wolf armor\n  - 💪 Buffed with **Strength II for 5 minutes (6000 ticks)**\n- Wolves automatically target nearby hostile mobs\n- Added **circular particle ring effect** on activation\n- Added powerful activation **sound effects**\n- Implemented **60-second cooldown system**\n\n---\n\n### ⚙️ Configuration (NEW)\n- Added a **config file** that is automatically generated on first launch\n\nYou can customize:\n- 🔢 Number of wolves spawned\n- 📏 Spawn radius of the circle\n- ⏱️ Cooldown duration\n- 💪 Strength effect duration & amplifier\n- 🐺 Wolf despawn time\n- 🎨 Toggle particle effects\n- 🔊 Toggle sound effects\n\nConfig file location:\n.minecraft/config/orbital_wolf_cannon.json\n\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Multiplayer\n- Fully compatible with multiplayer\n- Wolves are correctly owned by the player who summoned them\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ Technical\n- Built for **Fabric 1.21.11**\n- Uses Fabric API\n- Clean and optimized entity spawning logic\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Notes\n- This mod is intentionally powerful and designed for fun gameplay\n- Config allows full control for balancing\n\n---\n\n### 🐞 Known Issues\n- None currently\n\n---\n\n### 🔮 Upcoming Features\n- Elemental wolves (Fire, Ice, Shock)\n- Upgrade system\n- Advanced AI behaviors\n- More visual  effects\n\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-03-25_20 30 25\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4221d2d-c9bf-400f-8e00-b721f19f1e85\" />\n\n\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-03-25_20 30 35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ff44d57-16d2-4dcc-a8d6-cabc2d8c74a0\" />"
